Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Mga Direktor: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 6{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit biglang pumunta si Hae-in sa Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabugbog ako. Sinabi niya na ito ay isang pribadong bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako maninigarilyo, dahil may\Nare camera sa lahat ng dako.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Naka-off ang lahat ng camera,\Nawala ang mga katulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito lang ang pagkakataon ko. Hayaang manigarilyo ako ng isa at uminom ng baso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa susunod na lang tayo, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay ka. Bata pa ang gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala na si Hae-in, at umalis na rin si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang hindi sila magkasundo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit nakikiusap ako na iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gusto nila ang isa't isa,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pero hindi nila alam iyon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kaya hindi sila kailanman\Non the same page. Mga tanga.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,, Mangarap kung ang plano mo ay hanapin\Nsomething kay Hyun-woo at sipain siya palabas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatlong taon na siyang pinagmamasdan ni Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,at walang nahanap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Sinasabi ko sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ang isang taong malinis\Nay hindi magkakaroon ng ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim, bakit mo ako tinatawag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hindi tayo dapat magtawagan\Nkapag nagbabakasyon ang ating mga amo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ka? Isla ng Jeju?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sa isang lugar na mas maganda.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta sa punto. I'll hang up if you talk shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa Frankfurt ba si Ms. Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tingin ko lumipad palabas si Mr. Baek kahapon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi niya sinabi sa akin ang patutunguhan niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ko malalaman kung saan nagpunta ang boss mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit pumunta si Ms. Hong sa Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit curious ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigla silang umalis,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at nasa dilim ako.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang mag-abala na hanapin\N sila kung hindi nila sasabihin sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mali ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,, Dagdag pa, wala akong isang linggong pahinga sa mga taon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya huwag mo akong tawagan para sa mga walang kuwentang bagay\O mga importanteng bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,may nangyari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan sa mundo sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwi na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko dito ko makikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang mahimalang paraan ng pamumuhay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,o isang lugar na walang kalungkutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng gusto ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ay uuwi na kasama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat baliw kayong dalawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pero sa tingin mo ba magagawa mo iyon sa ibang lugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghihintay din sa akin ang aking mahal na asawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,uwi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder kung anong sikreto ang tinatago niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mahalaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang isang relasyon ay nakatali\Nupang gumuho ng isang lihim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang kapangyarihan nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit biglaan ang cup noodles?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong subukan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong puno ito ng mga kemikal at MSG,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,pero magagalit ako kung mamatay ako\N nang walang panlasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay lang ng tatlong minuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay magsasalita ako pansamantala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Magsasalita ako habang naghihintay, para hindi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,masyadong seryoso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga bagay na gusto kong gawin mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikinig ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag hawakan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,memorial services para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko gusto ang alinman sa mga pagkain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gusto mo akong gunitain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,isipin mo lang ako habang umiinom ng alak sa magandang lugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,at maglagay ng ilang Hercyna handbag sa mesa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganito ka ba\Ndahil tinanggihan ka ng clinic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari ka nilang tawagan pabalik\Nmay magandang balita sa hinaharap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumulat din ng magandang obitwaryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Magdagdag ng ilang nakakaantig na kwento tungkol sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, sigurado akong meron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayundin...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling alerto sa aking libing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng ayaw sa akin ay dadalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyeon-ju, Jeong-mi, Eun-jin, at Ye-na.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Makinig kang mabuti...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,sa sinasabi nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,At?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Idemanda silang lahat kung masama ang bibig nila sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Idemanda sila dahil sa paninirang-puri sa patay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ako?\N- Kung ganoon dapat ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dun ako sa kabaong.\N- Halika na.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa palagay ko walang magluluksa,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya dapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Iiyak ka diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Umiiyak kapag maraming tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas maganda kung may mga camera sa paligid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,ang umiyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo at hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong malungkot ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi kita gusto...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,para maging masyadong malungkot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mababahala ako kung maaalala mo ako magpakailanman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pero magagalit ako kung mabilis kang naka-move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ano ang dapat kong gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,tulad mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,para isipin na nakakahiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong maawa ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,na wala na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama na.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Natapos na ang iyong tatlong minuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huling isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,May testamento ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Isinulat ko ito bago tayo ikasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumanggi ang nanay ko na bigyan kami ng\Nblessing kung hindi ako sumulat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang mamanahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang sinasabi, pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ire-revise ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na darating ang araw na ito nang ganoon kaaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,sinulat ko lang to para magpakasal na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Galit ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpapasalamat ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,na gagawin mo iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Paki gawin iyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako papayag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At kailan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling ganap ka nang gumaling,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya mo yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero sa ngayon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lampas tatlong minuto na.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mababad sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibalik iyon. Kailangan na nating pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko ito mabili, kahit\Npagkatapos ng ilang buwang paghihintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit itinago niya ito sa kanyang aparador.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, paano na kaya ang mga pangyayari\Nout kung naging mayaman kami ng ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkaiba kaya ang buhay natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nainggit ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong mas matalino ako kay Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano siya naging pipi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala pa akong nakilalang sinumang\Nmas madaling lokohin kaysa sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya pwede mo siyang pakasalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung ano ang sinabi niya sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi ko gusto si Lee Seung-gi, sa kabila ng kanyang katanyagan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kumanta siya tungkol sa isang babaeng mas matanda sa kanya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ayoko sa mga babaeng mas matanda sa akin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bina-bully ako ng mga kapatid ko mula pa noong maliit ako,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kaya na-trauma ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nakikita ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Unang nagre-react ang katawan ko kapag may nakasalubong akong matandang babae.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nakaka-goosebumps at rashes ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kahit ako ay nabighani sa sarili ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Para akong age detector.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa tingin mo ang magiging reaksyon niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,kung nalaman niyang mas matanda sa kanya ang kanyang asawa\Talagang limang taon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo hinawakan ang ulo ng\Niron. Dalhin mo sa akin ang kutsilyong kawayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito? Ito ay ligaw na ginseng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lang basta basta\nginseng. Isang siglo na ang edad nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kaloob na ito mula sa Diyos ay kaya pang\N buhayin ang mga patay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Seryoso ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa matalinghagang pagsasalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pagkabalisa at labis na\Npagpapawis ni Soo-cheol ay dahil sa kanyang mahinang enerhiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya kailangan niya itong regular na kainin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang buong haba ng\Nito na ligaw na ginseng ay 4 na talampakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagkaroon na ako ng wild ginseng sa loob ng 20 taon na ngayon,\Nngunit hindi pa ako nakakita ng ganito kalaki dati.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, ibigay mo ito sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba ng wild ginseng?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, magkano ito? babayaran pa kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Binili ko ito walang iba kundi ang anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Para sa isa mo pang anak, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Bakit mo,\Nkapag napakalakas na niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba siyang maging Superwoman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya malakas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari din siyang magkasakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bihira lang sipon si Hae-in sa\Nher buhay, kaya huwag kang mag-alala sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinding-hindi mo magagarantiyahan ang kalusugan ng isang tao.\Nhindi ito nangangahulugan na magiging malusog siya magpakailanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo akong pangalagaan ang kalusugan ng mga anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uy, sabi mo 4 feet ang haba nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi mo ito hatiin kay Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman sa ayaw kong ibahagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang wild ginseng ay\Epektibo lang kung mayroon ka nito nang buo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let Hae-in have it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang sinabi sa loob\Nsa nakalipas na 20 taon, kaya bakit ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Itigil mo na ang pagiging gahaman kung matagal mo na yan, hamak ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Anong meron sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagay ko menopause na.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uy, kainin mo bago siya bumalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pakiputol ito sa pangatlo.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Umalis si Beom-seok papuntang Hawaii kagabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami nagkasama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapakain mo ba ang snail ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabasag ang shell ni Paengsun.\NSay sobrang sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan niyang kumain ng mga kabibi para sa mas maraming calcium,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi siya kakain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa iyo kung ang kuhol na iyon\Nbali ang shell nito at walang gana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayan na naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag nawalan ng shell ang kuhol...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam! Malamang na magiging slug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamamatay siya nang wala ang kanyang shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa madaling salita, siya ay nagdurusa\Nmula sa isang sakit na walang lunas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,May sakit siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong problema?\N- Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ito sa oras na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaawa-awa kong Beom-jun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikinalulungkot kong sabihin ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ikaw ang aming pinakanakakaawa\Nkapamilya pagkatapos ni Paengsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkaroon ng baso.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahimatay ka lang sa pag-inom, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang dapat kong gawin sa aking kawawang kapatid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat sila sa German.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in Germany, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I-off ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa kwarto ako matutulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang matulog kahit saan mo gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang kunin ko ang kwartong iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi yan ang sinabi ko.\Ntulog ka lang kung saan mo gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gawin ang gusto mo. Sundin ang iyong puso.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede bang...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, simula ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,pwede ba akong matulog sa kwarto mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi ka pa rin kumportable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sinabi iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong sinabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag magmadali sa konklusyon. ako ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,nag-iisip tungkol dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pag-isipan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,ngayon lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,o simula ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula sa araw na ito hanggang sa magpakailanman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sa araw na ito hanggang sa magpakailanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,, Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Deal.\N- I see. "Deal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang sinabi mo, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo ba si Kim Ye-na?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang CEO ng Royal, na nakilala namin sa Hercyna party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginagawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,sa isang aksidente sa sasakyan noong nakaraang linggo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay nahimatay at pumunta sa ED.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay sumugod ang kanyang asawa at ang kanyang abogado.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Attorney niya?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ng asawa niya ay namamatay na siya,\Nkaya gusto niyang pumirma siya ng ilang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperado niyang sinabi sa\Ndoktor na hindi pa siya maaaring mamatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil kailangan niyang pirmahan ang isang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdulot siya ng eksena at sinabing\Nkailangan niyang baguhin ang kanyang kalooban.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaingay niya kaya nagising siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita kong paparating na.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukha siyang human version ng Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano naging kasuklam-suklam ang halimaw na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa bingit ng kamatayan ang kanyang asawa,\Nat pera lang ang inaalagaan niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nararapat siyang mamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag magsalita nang malupit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.26,0:23:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Hindi lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang unang itatanong ng mga tao kapag\Nnarinig nila ang tungkol sa pagkamatay ng isang tao ay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"So sino ang tumatanggap ng lahat ng mana?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ang cash? Real estate?\NStocks? Inheritance tax?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,May nagsasabi pa nga na may\Nhusbands na tumatawa sa banyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,sa libing ng kanilang asawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lahat...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,ay katulad mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Tulad ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Naalala mo ba yung unang sinabi ni Nyou nung sinabi kong may sakit ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mahal kita, Hong Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mahal kita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mahal kita."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo bang ang mga salitang iyon ay labis akong naaliw?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.44,0:24:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag masyadong bigyan ng diin ang sinabi ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mong makita kung nakahinga ako ng maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpanic ka nung umubo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay ka lang? Mangyaring tumawag sa ambulansya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang pakialam sa aking\Nwill o sa kapalarang makukuha mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nagtanong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Napuyat ka magdamag na nag-aalala tungkol sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Asawa ko yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa kang uri.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang katulad ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,At ngayon lumipad ka sa buong mundo para lang sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.99,0:24:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Posible lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,salamat sa direktang paglipad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Talagang biniyayaan ako ng isang mabuting asawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.92,0:25:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ay isang bagay na wala ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, nasaan ka na?\NHindi ka pa nakakakuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin, hindi ako makakapunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dapat sinabi ko sa iyo, pero masyado akong abala.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.43,0:27:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko masabi sa ngayon. Mamaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.26,0:27:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagutin mo lang ako ng "oo" o "hindi."\NApinapahawak ka ba laban sa iyong kalooban?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong sinasabi mo? Hindi, hindi ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon bakit hindi ka makakapunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi ni Cheol-seung sa kanyang asawa na hindi siya makakapunta,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.02,0:27:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,at hinampas niya siya ng isang\Nslipper, ngunit dumating pa rin siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hinampas niya ang ulo ko.\N- So nasaan ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.45,0:27:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nagkakatuwaan kami.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dae-ho...\N- {\i1}Alam ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Malamang nagdala siya ng mga crates\Npuno ng soju at beer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Si Yeong-beom at Sang-pil\Nare ay malamang na nagsisindi ng kahoy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at may hawak kang pares ng sipit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.29,0:27:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sinong bumili nitong karne?\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Cheol-seung ay malamang na bumili ng pork shoulder,\Nsince it's chewier than pork belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron pa kaming pork neck. Ito ay makatas at malambot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:28:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, may makatas na leeg ng baboy,\Nchewy pork shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,beer, at soju,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.18,0:28:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi namin sila\Ntapos kung nandoon ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.55,0:28:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Masisira ko sana ang mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.31,0:28:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So nasaan ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya napunta ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas mabuting hindi mo ito pagsisihan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilulubog namin ang ilang inihaw na\Npork neck sa {\i1}gochujang,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,at maghalo rin ng ilang alak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, magsaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkakaroon kami ni Hae-in ng beer at {\i1}schweinshaxe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hoy, ano ang "schweinshaxe"?\N- Hindi ba German pig feet yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam. Magbabayad ka para dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko ibinabalik ang entry fee mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.17,0:28:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.17,0:28:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi makakapunta si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.34,0:28:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nahuli ba siya?\N- Diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbago na siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubos na siyang nagbago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, tingnan mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.28,0:29:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Naabot ng lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.07,0:31:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this treatment\Ncalled the "Filgrastim shot."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.65,0:31:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto nilang itaas ang WBC ko gamit niyan,\Kahit na hindi ito garantisado.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto pa rin nilang subukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, ang galing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Sinabi ko sa iyo na magkakaroon ng magandang balita.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:37.66, Default,,0,0,0,, Pagpapanatili ng mabuting immune system\Napakahalaga para sa paggamot na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Panatilihin ang magandang temperatura ng katawan,\Npara hindi ka sipon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.32,0:31:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiyaking mayroon ka ring protina,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,at lumayo sa mga hilaw na pagkain\Ning kaso ng pagkalason sa dugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.52,0:31:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mo malalaman ang mga bagay na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Common sense naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.95,0:31:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula kailan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta. Paano kita matutulungan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.44,0:32:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, kailangan mo akong tulungan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.95,0:32:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.79,0:32:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.87,0:32:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang galing.\N- Natutuwa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.71,0:32:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling alerto, pwede ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.43,0:33:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong mali?\N- "Anong mali"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.35,0:33:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.35,0:33:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa footage ka ng dashcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, tanga. Baka nahuli ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.90,0:33:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit parang mataba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahalaga ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.07,0:33:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nakatayo roon\Nnang may mga sasakyang umaandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.29,0:33:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kasalanan ko ba?\N- Saka akin ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba tayo nasa iisang team?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mo akong suportahan,\Npara maging maayos ako doon,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.50,0:33:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ko ang lahat ng trabaho at halos\Ncaught, salamat sa iyong kawalan ng kakayahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.57,0:33:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumahimik.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.59,0:33:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung hindi ito natagpuan ni Mr. Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling alerto.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Malapit na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.85,0:33:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Halos saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dadalhin ba ni Eun-sung ang mga big shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.15,0:33:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,at lunukin ng buo ang Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.61,0:33:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin mo lang ang iyong bahagi at umalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.53,0:33:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo iyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ano ang mangyayari sa pamilya\Nonce he took over Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.70,0:34:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mong sabihing nag-aalala ka kay Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.16,0:34:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling propesyonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakainsulto iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo may nararamdaman ako para sa idiot na yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.63,0:34:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan mo na lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kalimutan. Hindi ka mayaman madam\Ndahil lang tratuhin ka ng mga tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.51,0:34:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Ni hindi ko gustong maging isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.64,0:34:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi man lang ako manigarilyo sa kapayapaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Tumigil ka sa paninigarilyo, pwede ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.35,0:34:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinailangan kong matutunan kung paano mag-edit ng\Nmga video, para mabura ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.98,0:34:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,footage mo naninigarilyo sa hardin!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda iyan. Maging isang YouTuber kapag nagretiro ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.36,0:34:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.53,0:34:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan ka dumating?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.62,0:34:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang sinisigawan mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.66,0:34:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin? WHO?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Boses mo iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong sinabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.09,0:34:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, may narinig po ba kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, wala akong narinig.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay, tinatakot mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakit ng ulo ko, dahil hindi makatulog si\NI kagabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mo ng masahe sa anit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mong isawsaw ang iyong katawan\Nin muna ng pink salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.71,0:35:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang pinakamahusay na masahista kailanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.21,0:35:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas bumuti na ang pakiramdam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong pumunta si Mr. Baek sa Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.18,0:35:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.48,0:35:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagkamali ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong pagkakamali?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.91,0:36:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilang araw ang nakalipas,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.49,0:36:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasabi ko nang hindi sinasadya si Mr. Baek\Natungkol sa kalooban ni Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig daw niya lahat\Hinihiling ako ni Nand na sabihin ang totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.32,0:36:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong mahahanap niya sa huli\Nout, kaya sinabi ko sa kanya nang halos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At nagdudulot na siya ng mga isyu sa trabaho mula noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.97,0:36:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ginagawa ni Hong ang lahat ng kanyang makakaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,upang magsagawa ng investment\Nproyekto kasama si Mr. Yoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.73,0:36:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pero sinabi ni Mr. Baek na kailangan muna nilang kumuha ng validity test,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.23,0:36:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya nanganganib na makansela ang proyekto.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on a time crunch, Lolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung magbago ang isip ni Mr. Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.12,0:36:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Ang negosyo ay tungkol sa pagiging matatag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka dapat mabalisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika. Hindi kami ang namumuhunan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ang investor dito,\Nso bakit tayo nagkukuwenta?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:36:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,, Dapat tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.71,0:37:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba libre ang pera niya, tanga?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.09,0:37:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Hyun-woo ay maingat at maselan, kung mayroon man,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.84,0:37:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,gawin ang sinasabi niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.06,0:37:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakainis si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.82,0:37:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Chairman Hong.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.24,0:37:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Malapit nang magsimula ang scholarship ceremony.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Soo-cheol, makipaglaro sa iyong mga kaibigan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.66,0:37:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sa ganitong paraan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.41,0:37:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ngunit hindi ko sila kaibigan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hoy, how dare you throw\Na bola sa ulo ng kapatid ko?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Talagang pipi na siya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.44,0:38:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Paano kung maging tanga pa siya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano ang pangalan mo?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.03,0:38:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hong Hae-in. Bakit?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano ang deal niya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.99,0:38:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Tumigil sa pag-iyak.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.16,0:38:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Napakaingay mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.17,0:38:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hey.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Apo ka ba ng chairman?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}At siya ba ang iyong nakatatandang kapatid na babae?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.73,0:38:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ikaw ba ang nag-iisang anak na lalaki?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.60,0:38:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mayroon akong kuya,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.56,0:38:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero hindi na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.32,0:38:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I see... Kaya ikaw lang ang anak.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.86,0:38:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pumutok dito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Magpakasal tayo mamaya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.41,0:38:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Hindi.\N- Bakit hindi?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang liit mo...!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Lolo!{\c}{\i0}\N- Lolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.50,0:39:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag ka lang makinig sa kanya. Pakinggan mo rin ako. ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-isip ako ng matagal bago ito ilabas,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.05,0:39:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- so bakit mo...?\N- Anong tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamusta si Geon-u...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,sobrang gwapo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.90,0:39:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka niya hinahabol.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.78,0:39:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Halos kambal kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.62,0:39:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-DNA test ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.91,0:39:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre, sa sandaling siya ay ipinanganak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita mo ang resulta.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,99.99% silang magkatugma.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo nakikita si Da-hye dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.42,0:39:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uy, formality ang DNA test.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumuha ka ng isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.55,0:39:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang bastos sa lolo mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbibiro lang ako, since sobrang gwapo at matalino si\NGeon-u.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya kong tiisin ang mga tao...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.10,0:40:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,bad-mouthing my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi ang aking asawa o anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.15,0:40:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi yata ako makakain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.52,0:40:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.82,0:40:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakakilabot na anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, kaya niyang tiisin ang\Nmga taong nagmumura sa kanyang mga magulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo yung kilay niya.\NI had the same one as a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila ay lumapot sa paglipas ng panahon,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.17,0:40:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,at tingnan ang kanyang ilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.63,0:40:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Natamaan ang ilong ko habang naglalaro ng soccer,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya medyo mababa,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.01,0:40:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pareho ako ng ilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.26,0:40:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakataas ng nose bridge ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Akala ng mga tao mixed ako.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.10,0:40:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kanyang makapal na buhok at ang kanyang mga daliri sa paa...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.56,0:40:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Masama ang loob ko para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.19,0:40:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat malakas ang pamilya natin\Ngenes. Hindi ka niya kamukha.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:41:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bakit?\N- Ako ang pinakamahina sa pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gina-amo ako ng kapatid ko, at palagi akong pinapagalitan ng aking\Ngrandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.08,0:41:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ikaw ay minamaltrato.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.09,0:41:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko pa,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.25,0:41:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya walang maglalakas loob na tratuhin ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Matatamaan ang resort complex project. Gagawin ko ang lahat para sa kapakanan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.81,0:41:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Magtiwala ka sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo kulang sa luto.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.31,0:41:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maluluto ito habang kumakain tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.52,0:41:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, sir. Maaari ba akong humingi ng direksyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.32,0:41:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, natagpuan mo ang tamang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.83,0:41:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko lahat ng sementadong kalsada at\Nunpaved na kalsada sa paligid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko kung saan pupunta ang mga aso,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.50,0:41:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,at kahit saan lumipad ang mga ibon. alam ko ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- kaya tanungin mo ako.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.59,0:41:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang lugar na nasa YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.34,0:41:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Alam mo ba kung saan ito?\N- YouTube?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.38,0:41:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa YouTube ba ang village natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.30,0:42:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Aling lugar iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.97,0:42:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dito.\N- Tahan na.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.65,0:42:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ito dapat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.11,0:42:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba umupo dito si Hong Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.07,0:42:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.86,0:42:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.45,0:42:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa nilang lahat doon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Doon nakaupo si Hae-in.\NA upuan ng conglomerate heiress,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.45,0:42:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,at iyon ang pader na kanyang sinandalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.16,0:42:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang posing sa harap ng Berlin Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang bagay na ganyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagaya nila ang ginawa ni\NHae-in sa kanyang libreng oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.34,0:42:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba iyon ang aso?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.34,0:42:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hae-in, pakisabi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.97,0:42:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kumusta. Ako si Hong Hae-in ng Queens Group.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.06,0:42:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ang pinakamahusay na pinuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.64,0:42:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba ito ang aso?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.09,0:42:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ito nga.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.15,0:42:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.44,0:42:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.46,0:42:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pare, sumikat si Yongdu-ri.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.95,0:42:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Binisita si Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.41,0:43:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Nandito si Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.83,0:43:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi nila tayo papasukin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.63,0:43:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakagat si Hae-in ng isang itik nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon pumila ang mga tao para kumain dito...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.21,0:43:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,sa madaling araw, pero hindi pa rin makapasok.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.14,0:43:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Parehong ang marinated-crab at\Nfrozen-pork-belly restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.93,0:43:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,, ay ganap na naka-book at naghahatid saanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.31,0:43:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakabaliw.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.81,0:43:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit nila ginagawa ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.35,0:43:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Baka hindi sila\Ngabihis tulad ng mayaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.55,0:43:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya gusto nilang kumain man lang kagaya nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.77,0:43:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.07,0:43:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Hae-in ang pinakamaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsumikap ako sa loob ng ilang dekada na ipakilala si Yongdu-ri,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit naabot niya iyon sa wala pang isang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.95,0:43:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ligtas na sabihin na ikaw ay\Nang mataas na kamay sa halalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumutulong ang iyong manugang sa ating ekonomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.75,0:43:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa ni Seok-hun?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.59,0:44:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet feeling niya talunan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.84,0:44:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka gusto niyang pumunta si Hae-in sa restaurant ng kanyang ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.89,0:44:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdududa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.56,0:44:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ngumunguya nang dahan-dahan, o magkakaroon ka ng sakit ng tiyan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ang mansanas ay pinakamainam para sa hindi pagkatunaw ng pagkain.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.03,0:44:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit niya kakainin iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,, Dapat ay peras na lang ang dala niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so bakit mansanas?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.71,0:44:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seok-hun, ang tusong hamak na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.75,0:44:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongdu-ri ay naging\Nhome sa mga mansanas sa mga tagalabas,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.50,0:44:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil lang kumagat si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ito ay "game over."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.09,0:44:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Katumbas ng Masasarap na Mansanas{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.55,0:44:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilisan natin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.22,0:44:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Abala ka na sa wakas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakagandang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.15,0:44:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin ang buong kahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Trending ang video.\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.82,0:45:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Naabot ito ng mahigit 500,000 view.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon, naging fan ako\Nof Ms. Hong pagkatapos ng kanyang pagbisita.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.78,0:45:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano nagkaroon ng halo sa paligid niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,nung nagpakilala siya\Na ang manugang ng pamilya?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.21,0:45:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,May lobster truck\Nsa likod niya. Baka yun na yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.50,0:45:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito. Tingnan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.42,0:45:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,May nag-order ng aming marinated crab na taga-Jeju.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, ang alimango ko ay bibisitahin ang Jeju bago ko gawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.72,0:45:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Swerte mo.\N- Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.23,0:45:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.39,0:45:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong mali?\N- Anong ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.19,0:45:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Para kang gutom na babae...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.90,0:45:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,sino ang nabigo na\Nwala nang kanin sa cooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.36,0:45:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipino-promote ni Seok-hun ang kanyang mga mansanas,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.61,0:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so paano ka makakapag-upload ng\Nvideo ni Hae-in na kumakain ng isa?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.94,0:45:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ikaw ba?\N- Ako ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.58,0:45:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin, ie-edit ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.29,0:45:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan ito. Mahigit 500,000 tao ang nanood nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.33,0:45:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huli na ang lahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.25,0:45:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos hilingin natin na bumisita ulit si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.38,0:46:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Dapat siyang dumating.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.44,0:46:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari siyang gumawa ng isang palabas sa pagkain kasama ang mga peras ng iyong ama,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.01,0:46:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,at strut down sa Landas ni Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.20,0:46:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong landas?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsimula ng bagong proyekto ang asosasyon ng kababaihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula nang sumikat ang village namin,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.22,0:46:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,dedekorasyunan namin ang pasukan\Nand na tinatawag itong "Hong Hae-in's Path."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.35,0:46:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tama iyan.\N- Makukuha natin ang portrait rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.69,0:46:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay ipapakita namin ang larawan nila ni Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.31,0:46:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala rin bilang "Yongdu-ri Queen's Path."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lakad sa landas na ito,\Nand ang iyong pag-ibig ay magkakatotoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Idagdag din natin yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.82,0:46:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lumabas ka!\N- Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.49,0:46:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lumabas at huwag bumisita anumang oras sa lalong madaling panahon!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.54,0:46:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.45,0:46:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.33,0:46:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.71,0:46:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen's Hair Salon{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huli na. May asawa na siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.64,0:46:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mas maaga kang dumating ng limang taon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Umalis ka na lang ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.45,0:47:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Madaling kumusta ang mga tao dito kung dumikit ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.71,0:47:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang magandang kultura.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.75,0:47:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat masaya ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,na sikat ka sa lahat ng babae,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.26,0:47:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,kabilang ang anak na babae ng Yongdu-ri principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.26,0:47:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anak ng principal?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.59,0:47:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So-yeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.71,0:47:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba ang pangalan niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.52,0:47:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Balita ko mabait siya at maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.69,0:47:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.19,0:47:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute siya at maikli ang buhok.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginawa niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.15,0:47:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.41,0:47:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ba ang first love mo na binanggit ni Mi-seon?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.78,0:47:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya ang first love ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.46,0:48:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung kilala siya ng buong pamilya mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.71,0:48:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ibig sabihin engaged na kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.54,0:48:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.75,0:48:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.51,0:48:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi man lang kami nagtanghalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.09,0:48:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We never did anything,\Nso how is she my first love?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang kailangang gawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.39,0:48:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Masaya kang panoorin sila mula sa malayo.\NHindi mo maiwasang isipin sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.39,0:48:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,, Lumihis ka para lang makita silang muli.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung first time mong gawin ang mga iyon,\Nyan ang first love mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.99,0:48:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ay medyo tiyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.45,0:48:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagsasalita mula sa karanasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Masasabi mo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.33,0:48:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Masaya kang makita siya mula sa malayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.12,0:48:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo maiwasang isipin siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.79,0:48:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at lumihis ka pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.64,0:49:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bawat babae ay umiibig sa isa kahit isang beses.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.97,0:49:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang lalaki sa bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang lalaki sa bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.35,0:49:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakasakay ka ba papuntang school?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.17,0:49:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga CCTV camera ay hindi gumagana\Nkanina lamang, at sila ang mga repairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.89,0:49:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aabutin ito ng halos isang oras, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.03,0:50:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos na ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kasunduan sa Diborsiyo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.63,0:50:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sigurado akong mahirap para sa iyo\Ntoo. Nagtagal ka sa paligid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.65,0:50:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahanap mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.41,0:50:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.91,0:50:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sigurado ka bang ito na?\N- Sa tingin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.41,0:50:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatlong taon na ang nakalipas.\NBaka itinapon nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.25,0:50:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.57,0:51:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabuti naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.39,0:51:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon ba silang ganoon katagal?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga taong iyon ay\Nwalang ginagawa sa harap ng fountain na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.06,0:51:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsasayang lang sila ng oras sa sunbathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.86,0:51:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapakain lang nila ang mga kalapati.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.15,0:52:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpapahinga sila habang gumagawa ng mga walang kabuluhang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto. Nag-aaksaya sila ng oras sa paggawa ng mga walang kabuluhang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.54,0:52:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipinagyayabang ba nila ang oras na mayroon sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano ka-extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.76,0:52:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Swerte para sa pagbebenta. Bumili ng swerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.80,0:52:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumuha ng swerte sa sarili mong mga kamay. Swerte para sa pagbebenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.43,0:52:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumili ng swerte. Halina't kunin ang iyong suwerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.60,0:52:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinusubukang kumita ng pera\Nof common four-leaf clovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.65,0:52:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong panloloko.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.42,0:52:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng tanga ang bibili ng mga ganoong bagay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakukuha mo ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.80,0:53:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, katuwaan lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.56,0:53:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahal iyon para sa ilang dahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.77,0:53:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.02,0:53:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo natulala ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.10,0:53:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit? Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.77,0:54:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang bigat ko...\N- Ang bigat mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumaas ito ng 6 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadagdagan ako ng 6 pounds simula\N ang pagbisita ko sa ospital sa Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.70,0:54:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Hindi ka ba normal na pumapayat kapag may sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.90,0:54:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Importante ba iyon sa ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.45,0:54:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang alam mo? Wala pang nagsabi sa\Nyou na may natitira kang tatlong buwan para mabuhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.63,0:54:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Naging maganda ako sa buong buhay ko,\Nso paano kung maging pangit ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.38,0:54:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaalala mo lang ang pangit kong mukha.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.09,0:54:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako papayag.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.47,0:54:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.52,0:54:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka maniniwala sa akin kung sinabi kong maganda ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,kahit ang timbang mo, pwede ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.82,0:54:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.98,0:54:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumaba ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi yun ang ibig kong sabihin.\N- Manood ka na lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging maganda ako hanggang sa mamatay ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.46,0:55:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Babalik ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:57:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagugutom ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.91,0:58:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano mo ako katagal hinahanap?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.83,0:58:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Para sa halos isang oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.38,0:58:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy na nawawala ang oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala na akong masyadong oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.72,0:58:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo na naaalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.01,0:58:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, ginagawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.97,0:58:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- May nakita lang ako.\N- Sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.31,0:58:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ang kuya ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.18,0:59:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Noong siyam ako,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.31,0:59:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nakasakay kami sa bangka\Nsa aming bakasyon sa tag-araw.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.35,0:59:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naranasan namin ang isang mahiwagang aksidente.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Ayan!\N- Hae-in!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.21,0:59:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hae-in! Kabutihan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.38,0:59:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, Hae-in!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.88,0:59:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay ka lang?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.80,0:59:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Okay ka lang?\N- Nay, nasaan si Su-wan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.80,1:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Iniligtas niya ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.01,1:00:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.93,1:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Siya ay...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.27,1:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.85,1:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.15,1:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.57,1:00:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pakiligtas ang aking anak!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.44,1:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Su-wan!\N- Isa, dalawa, tatlo, apat.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.24,1:00:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Lima, anim, pito, walo, siyam...\N- Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.86,1:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ganyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.41,1:00:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}namatay siya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.33,1:00:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pagkatapos mawala ang kanyang anak,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.83,1:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hindi kaya ng nanay ko...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.92,1:00:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kumain, matulog, o patawarin mo ako...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.84,1:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sa napakatagal na panahon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.01,1:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at masama ang pakiramdam ko...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.55,1:00:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}para kay Su-wan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.59,1:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi mo kasalanan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.02,1:00:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.90,1:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi ko maalis ang pagkakasala,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.94,1:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil parang...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.44,1:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninakaw ko ang buhay niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.99,1:01:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko ito sa isang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.83,1:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag malapit ka nang mamatay,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.95,1:01:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,sinundo ka ng taong pinakamamahal\Nyo...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.25,1:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,sa anyo ng isang anghel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.79,1:01:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Su-wan...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,na nag-alay ng buhay para sa akin...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka dumating siya...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.06,1:01:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil oras na.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.02,1:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang delirium ay isa sa maraming\Nside effect ng iyong injection.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.45,1:01:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa itong hallucination. Hindi ito anghel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.62,1:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahagi ito ng paggamot.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.18,1:02:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi madali...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.43,1:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,upang makaligtas sa isang sakit,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.35,1:02:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,pero...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,dapat kang humabol, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.11,1:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.86,1:02:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,at gagawin ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.28,1:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,pero...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,sabihin na nating maraming oras ang lumipas,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.08,1:02:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,at namatay ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.37,1:02:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay magiging anghel ako at susunduin kita.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.64,1:02:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung magpakita ako,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi gaanong nakakatakot para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.10,1:03:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.41,1:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Na hindi gaanong nakakatakot?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. Ako ang magiging pinakamagandang anghel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.16,1:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.87,1:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.67,1:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gawin mo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.05,1:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit sa ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,hukayin natin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.77,1:03:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.15,1:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain na tayo...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.44,1:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,at manatiling matatag.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.96,1:04:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Juseong Tech{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.84,1:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.14,1:04:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sarado{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.22,1:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Data Recovery\NJuseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Nag-shut Down Kami para sa Mga Personal na Dahilan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo. Tamang-tama yan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay hilagang-kanluran.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.99,1:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang direksyon na nasa\Nsingil ng pera, tagumpay, at suwerte.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.87,1:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaganda ng paglalagay mo\Nan enterprising painting...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.74,1:04:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,ganito dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.79,1:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa wakas ay nahanap na nito ang may-ari nito.\NIMukhang mas maganda dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.87,1:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Binigyan mo ako ng napakalaking regalo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.50,1:04:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kita mababayaran?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na kailangan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.67,1:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay ko lang ito sa iyo bilang paggalang.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.05,1:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.34,1:04:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol sa resort complex na iyon...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.64,1:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko ang isang consulting firm na\N sinusuri ang validity at profitability nito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, pinayuhan ako ng aking apo na gawin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa ako. Buti na lang sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikipag-usap ako sa ibang kumpanya\Nto, kaya huwag kang ma-pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Iba pang kumpanya? Balita ko, busy si\NChairman Yeom lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.99,1:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikipag-usap ka rin ba sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.49,1:05:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, sana Chairman Yeom...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.04,1:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,ay hindi nagnanakaw ng magandang pagkakataon mula sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.46,1:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi maaaring mangyari iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.08,1:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sir.\N- Ano yun?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.71,1:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano karaming pera ang nilustay ni Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.01,1:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,$13 milyon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,At walang nakakaalam?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.01,1:05:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- This whole time?\N- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.72,1:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Itinakda niya ang sahod ng mga manggagawa...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.26,1:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,mas mataas sa normal, o\Nmanipuladong financial statement...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.98,1:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,batay sa mga certificate ng deposito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.27,1:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tikom ba niya ang kanyang bibig?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.15,1:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandoon ang aming mga abogado habang\Nnagtatanong sa kanya ang prosekusyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.19,1:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi niya sasabihin sa isang kaluluwa,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.49,1:05:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,pero eto ang problema.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.53,1:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay medyo mabigat na halaga, kaya\Nkasangkot ang mga nakatataas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.24,1:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari ka rin nilang ipatawag,\Nkaya dapat kang maghanda,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.70,1:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,pero siyempre, gagawin ng aming law firm ang kanilang makakaya para maiwasan iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.86,1:06:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.88,1:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, Ama.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.00,1:06:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol kay Mr. Song.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.17,1:06:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinahabol nila ako!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.13,1:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang gumawa nito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.76,1:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nagsabi sa prosekusyon tungkol dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay malamang na isang taong malapit sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahanapin ko sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.27,1:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Babayaran nila ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.15,1:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.61,1:06:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.79,1:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang RF transmitter VOX listening device.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.25,1:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Naa-activate lang ito kapag nakarinig ito ng\Ntiyak na antas ng ingay o boses ng tao.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.13,1:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang walang-hiya para gawin ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.88,1:06:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil sa laki ng device na ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.76,1:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko makakahanap tayo ng microwave\Nreceiver sa 1-milya na radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.57,1:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Maaari naming ilipat ang\N$30 milyon sa account ni Mr. Jin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.07,1:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pagkatapos ay ibenta ang mga stock sa ilalim ng mga hiniram na\Nnames at ipadala ang mga ito sa maliliit na piraso.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Oo, gawin iyon at ipaalam kay Mr. Jin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.78,1:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Maghintay.\N{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Oo, sir.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.83,1:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ito nasa opisina ni Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.54,1:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano pa ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.33,1:08:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}May safe sa kwarto ni Mr. Baek.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Buksan ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.47,1:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi kita maabot?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.76,1:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung ano ang nangyari kagabi?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.10,1:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-bug ang pag-aaral ng lolo mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nasa gilid na siya...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.44,1:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dahil ang kanyang financial manager\Nay inakusahan ng panghoholdap.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.98,1:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- "So"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.53,1:08:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I-set up ng asawa mo ang bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.70,1:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,May proof ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.70,1:08:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya nga ako tumatawag.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.83,1:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakita kami ng receiver sa kwarto niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.04,1:08:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring ilagay ito ng kahit sino\Ndoon habang wala kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.16,1:08:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang laman ang bahay nang ilang araw.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.75,1:08:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gago ba kayong lahat?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.75,1:08:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang kumampi sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.54,1:09:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd found it weird that Hyun-woo was\Nso against Soo-cheol's business idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the CCTV cameras before\Npointing your finger at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.05,1:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nanay{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.61,1:09:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Ako na lang ang meron sayo, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.94,1:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aminin mo na lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.95,1:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, nandito ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.24,1:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarado ang tindahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.58,1:09:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, para sa kabutihan. Nagsara na sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.16,1:09:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibinigay mo sa kanila?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.29,1:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay tumingin sa kabilang kalye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.87,1:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandoon ang sasakyan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.92,1:09:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Pampublikong Paradahan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Hindi ka nagsisinungaling.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nagpark dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.96,1:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang susi ay nasa kanang gulong sa harap.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.76,1:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.89,1:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipadala sa akin ang SD card ng dashcam ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.10,1:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,at alamin kung kailan nagsara ang tindahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.81,1:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaso ba ito, may suspect?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.27,1:09:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang bagay na ganyan. Salamat nang maaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring isa akong divorce attorney,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pero noon pa man ay gusto ko\N na magtrabaho sa mga kasong kriminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.28,1:10:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.96,1:10:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka nagpunta?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.09,1:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ay nasa telepono.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.01,1:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol saan ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.43,1:10:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinatawagan ko si Yang-gi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.47,1:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,May tumawag ba sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.51,1:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng sino?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.39,1:10:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay ko o iba pa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.77,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag tumanggap ng anumang mga tawag mula sa aking pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.78,1:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wag na lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.82,1:10:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Biyenan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mong sagutin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.79,1:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako ma-stress kapag kumukuha ng mga injection.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.75,1:11:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Power Off{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.81,1:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito si Moh Seul-hee.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Oh Sun-yeong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Si Seul-hee naman.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya si Oh Sun-yeong na namatay 30 taon na ang nakakaraan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.40,1:11:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya itong Oh Sun-yeong ay namatay 30 taon na ang nakakaraan,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.16,1:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- at siya talaga si Moh Seul-hee?\N- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.87,1:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon nasaan ang totoong Moh Seul-hee?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.75,1:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako sigurado. Gayunpaman...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.46,1:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Inaresto si Sun-yeong dahil sa pangangalunya\Ntatlong taon bago ang kanyang kamatayan,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.18,1:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,at nanganak siya sa likod ng mga bar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.60,1:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,May anak na siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.39,1:11:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.39,1:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nakulong noong 4 na buwang buntis\NGKapanganakan ng lalaki{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.86,1:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pare, maghintay tayo hanggang dumating si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.36,1:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumahimik ka!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.34,1:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.34,1:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- How dare he?\N- Ano yun?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.79,1:12:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.04,1:12:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.06,1:12:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lagda: Baek Hyun-woo\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.94,1:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko bang magdasal?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalabas bukas ang resulta ng therapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.41,1:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko lahat ng swerte na makukuha ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.24,1:13:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit may mahabang pila?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba nating suriin ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.12,1:13:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo gustong maghintay sa pila.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.75,1:13:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, hindi ko ginagawa iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.51,1:13:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Para akong ordinaryong tao. Ayoko niyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.05,1:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.22,1:13:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,kakaibang,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.68,1:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong maging ordinaryo kahit minsan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.77,1:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong maghintay sa pila at\Nsana magka-kebab pa sila...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.23,1:13:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,naiwan para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.19,1:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka pumila?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.95,1:13:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Babalik ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.91,1:14:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan niya...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.49,1:14:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,lahat ng suwerteng makukuha niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.50,1:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo pa rin sila maabot?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.75,1:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, naka-off ang kanilang mga telepono.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.88,1:14:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Isang divorce?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.84,1:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Napatingin ako sa kanya,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.80,1:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang kaibigang nakilala niya\Npinakadalas nitong mga araw...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.26,1:14:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,ay si Kim Yang-gi, isang abugado ng diborsiyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring wala iyon,\Npero may mas malaking problema.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.23,1:14:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dito nagtatrabaho si Mr. Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.40,1:14:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Si Apollon.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.32,1:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba law firm ni Chairman Yeom?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.07,1:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, kaya nag-aalala ako na\NMr. Baka binigay ni Baek...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.24,1:15:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,ang mga bugged files sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.03,1:15:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin, si Hyun-woo\N ang whistleblower, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.87,1:15:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka dapat pumunta sa mga konklusyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.57,1:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.58,1:15:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi alam ni Hyun-woo\Nanything tungkol sa secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.96,1:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayokong marinig. Tawagan mo sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.09,1:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo silang umuwi ngayon din!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.02,1:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahanap ko na.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.40,1:16:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito pa rin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.46,1:16:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seryoso ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nanay{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.48,1:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Tatay{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.28,1:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.95,1:17:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.17,1:18:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon? Ano ang hawak niya?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.71,1:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nanay\NBagong Mensahe{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.21,1:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, nahanap ko na. On my way here...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.82,1:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.07,1:19:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ito totoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.95,1:19:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo na.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.66,1:19:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanggihan ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.42,1:19:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Sabihin mo na.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.29,1:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ito totoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.09,1:19:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ikaw iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.48,1:19:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.73,1:19:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.99,1:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na hindi ko masabi sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.36,1:21:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay lang ako. Kunin mo.\N- Mr. Baek...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.60,1:21:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang talaga ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.66,1:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.17,1:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,May driver ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.10,1:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay. Dahan-dahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.52,1:21:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.94,1:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bagalan nang kaunti.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.23,1:22:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Natutuwa kang panoorin sila mula sa malayo.\NHindi mo maiwasang isipin sila.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.36,1:22:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lumihis ka para lang makita silang muli.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.20,1:22:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kung ginawa mo ang mga iyon sa unang pagkakataon,\Nkung gayon iyon ang iyong unang pag-ibig.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.75,1:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, sundan mo ang bus na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.21,1:22:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.67,1:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang bus na iyon ay tatawid sa tulay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.34,1:22:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Mangyaring sundin ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.97,1:24:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ibinigay mo na ba ang lahat?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.46,1:24:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ano ang gagawin mo? Gumawa ng isang bagay kung kaya mo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.13,1:25:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ihinto ang paglalaro. Naiinis ka sa akin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.38,1:25:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ni-bug niya ang kwarto mo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.80,1:25:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ngunit natatanaw ko sila.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.47,1:25:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Bakit mo gagawin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.26,1:25:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Alam niya ang tungkol sa diborsyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.72,1:25:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Gagawin iyon ng audit team.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.43,1:25:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Itataboy ka nang walang awa.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.60,1:25:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- {\i1}Pinadala niya ang mga bulaklak sa isang Kim Min-ji.\N- Nasaan siya ngayon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Gaano ka-feisty.{\i0}
